Thistle gets along wonderfully with other dogs and will likely do well with cats, too. She doesn''t need much, just a warm, loving place to call home and someone who will cherish her as much as she deserves. If you''re looking for a gentle little companion to add some sweetness to your days, Thistle may be your perfect match.

Thistle joined us from Hitchcock Road Animal Services after she was found as a stray. Due to her senior status, they felt she would do best in a senior-focused rescue.', short_description = 'Tiny Thistle is a sweet little autumn treasure with a gentle, mellow nature and a heart loaded with love. Just like the soft, silvery plant she''s named after, Thistle is delicate, charming, and quietly beautiful.', looks_like = 'Chihuahua mix', sex = 'Female', age_years = 14, weight_lbs = 5, intake_date = COALESCE(intake_date, '2026-10-30'), is_draft = 0, is_active = 1, needs_review = 0, is_courtesy = 0, is_available = 1, is_adopted = 0, is_hospice = 0, is_foster_needed = 0, is_temp_foster_needed = 0, is_adoption_pending = 0, foster_start_date = NULL, foster_end_date = NULL WHERE id = 2341 AND name = 'Thistle';
