UPDATE animals SET name_public = IF(COALESCE(name_public, '') = '', 'Pocket', name_public), description = 'Pocket is compact, endearing, and precious, just like a little, magical treasure. With his scruffy good looks, this bundle of joy brings happiness into hearts and homes. His favorite pastimes include soaking up all the belly rubs he can possibly get, zooming through the yard, squeaking his squeaky toys, chasing squirrels, softly howling with emergency vehicle sirens, and showing off his tiny-but-mighty superstar energy. He is playful, silly, and always up for a little fun. Pocket is perfectly house-trained, well-behaved during bath time, and greets you with excitement whenever you get home. His foster family reports that he is a great companion on long road trips and that he is especially adorable first thing in the morning when he snuggles his face against you to show his deep affection.

Pocket prefers to be around adult humans and thrives when he can be the apple of your eye all day, every day. With his senior status comes the privilege of being a bit set in his ways and knowing what he wants; thus, for his golden years, he is looking for a loving adult-only, single-dog, feline-free household where yummy treats and sweet snuggles are plentiful. This guy will have you in his pocket in no time.

