-- Tiny Dancer (adoptable; matched by Shelterluv number)
UPDATE animals SET name_public = IF(COALESCE(name_public, '') = '', 'Tiny Dancer', name_public), description = 'Tiny Dancer is the definition of gentle. He has a calm, mellow spirit that instantly puts people at ease, and he''s happiest simply being near the people he loves. He''s the kind of dog who doesn''t ask for much -- just a cozy bed, a few kind words, and someone to share life''s quiet moments.

This sweet little gentleman is deaf and may be missing his lower jaw, but he hasn''t let it steal an ounce of his charm. In fact, it''s just one more thing that makes him completely unforgettable. Every little expression, every happy wag, and every soft look reminds you that perfection comes in all shapes, sizes, and smiles. Tiny Dancer is living proof that the things that make us different are often the things that make us the most lovable. He''s resilient, incredibly sweet, and full of personality. Tiny Dancer loves treats and being pushed in his stroller, though he is learning to walk well on leash. This little guy is also great with dogs of all sizes.

Whether he''s toddling alongside you, soaking up affection, or simply keeping you company, he has a way of making ordinary days feel a little more special.

Tiny Dancer joined us from the Animal Resource Center of the Inland Empire after he was found as a stray. Due to his senior status and their overcrowded shelter, they felt he would do best in a senior-focused rescue.', short_description = 'Tiny Dancer is the definition of gentle. He has a calm, mellow spirit that instantly puts people at ease, and he''s happiest simply being near the people he loves.', looks_like = 'Terrier mix', sex = 'Male', age_years = 13, weight_lbs = 6, sponsored_by = 'Kennon Hudson', intake_date = COALESCE(intake_date, '2026-07-31'), is_draft = 0, is_active = 1, needs_review = 0, is_courtesy = 0, is_available = 1, is_adopted = 0, is_hospice = 0, is_foster_needed = 0, is_temp_foster_needed = 0, is_adoption_pending = 0, foster_start_date = NULL, foster_end_date = NULL WHERE id = 2217 AND name = 'Tiny Dancer';
-- Tang (adoptable; matched by Shelterluv number)
UPDATE animals SET name_public = IF(COALESCE(name_public, '') = '', 'Tang', name_public), description = 'Looking to add a splash of sweetness to your life? Meet Tang, a charming senior fellow who''s guaranteed to brighten your day! This handsome guy is great with other dogs and always seems ready to make a new friend. He is always happy to meet dogs, and when he''s a little excited, he is easily redirected. His pep truly shows when he''s about to go on a walk. The rest of his time, he''s a mellow guy. Whether he''s hanging out with his canine pals, exploring the world on a walk, or curling up after a day of fun, he brings just the right amount of zest wherever he goes.

He doesn''t usually play with toys, though he may snuggle with them in bed! He loves to be with his favorite people and is a good travel companion! If you''re searching for a loyal companion with plenty of charm and a heart full of sweetness, Tang may be just the flavor you''ve been looking for. Come meet this citrusy cutie and see why everyone who meets him finds him simply irresistible!

Tang joined us from The Animal Resource Center of the Inland Empire. Due to overcrowding, they reached out in hopes that we could help find space for a few of the incredible seniors in their care.', short_description = 'Looking to add a splash of sweetness to your life? Meet Tang, a charming senior fellow who''s guaranteed to brighten your day! This handsome guy is great with other dogs and always seems ready to make a new friend.', looks_like = 'Terrier mix', sex = 'Male', age_years = 12, weight_lbs = 15, intake_date = COALESCE(intake_date, '2026-07-17'), is_draft = 0, is_active = 1, needs_review = 0, is_courtesy = 0, is_available = 1, is_adopted = 0, is_hospice = 0, is_foster_needed = 0, is_temp_foster_needed = 0, is_adoption_pending = 0, foster_start_date = NULL, foster_end_date = NULL WHERE id = 2180 AND name = 'Tang';
-- Praline (adoptable; matched by Shelterluv number)
UPDATE animals SET name_public = IF(COALESCE(name_public, '') = '', 'Praline', name_public), description = 'If you are looking for a sweet treat without the extra sugar and calories, then this Praline is made for you! Praline is a mellow and gentle soul who is looking for lots of affection, yummy treats, and a calm, peaceful home where she can enjoy a slower pace of life. Get comfortable on the sofa with a good book in your hand, and this little delight will be happy to curl up next to you. When it is feeding time, she will perk right up and perform a little twirly dance on her back feet. For bedtime, she loves to be under the blankets snuggled up by your side. She is happiest when she can be near the people she loves all day, every day. Before joining our program, she did not get a chance to live life to the fullest, and she is eager to catch up on the plush, pampered poodle lifestyle.

At her foster home, Praline gets along well with her canine siblings, even sharing a bed with dogs much larger than her! She prefers gentle, calm dogs that respect her personal space, speed, and size. She is a perfect car-ride companion, either looking out the window or snoozing in her seat. At home, she is fully house-trained and low maintenance. She would do best in a house without stairs, or where she can be carried up and down stairs, due to some mobility and vision limitations. This little survivor had a complete mastectomy and is currently on Meloxicam.

Praline joined us from Santa Cruz County Animal Services after she was found as a stray. Due to her senior status and her need for medical attention, they reached out to find her the perfect retirement home. Praline''s ideal day is sitting by the open door, snuggled by your side as you enjoy a good book. If you''re looking for a gentle soul to share your days with, Praline may be the perfect match.', short_description = 'If you are looking for a sweet treat without the extra sugar and calories, then this Praline is made for you!', looks_like = 'Poodle mix', sex = 'Female', age_years = 13, weight_lbs = 9, intake_date = COALESCE(intake_date, '2026-07-25'), is_draft = 0, is_active = 1, needs_review = 0, is_courtesy = 0, is_available = 1, is_adopted = 0, is_hospice = 0, is_foster_needed = 0, is_temp_foster_needed = 0, is_adoption_pending = 0, foster_start_date = NULL, foster_end_date = NULL WHERE id = 2205 AND name = 'Praline';
