While in our program, we found Spork to need liver support, have Cushing''s disease, kidney disease, and to have a heart murmur. Due to the medical support that she needs daily, we found it best to make her a permanent POMDR pup to reside in her loving foster home.Please consider sponsoring Gigi (aka Spork)''s forever care.', short_description = 'Sweet little miss Spork- or Gigi as her hospice foster calls her, joined us from San Jose Animal Care Center and Services after she was found wandering the streets as a stray, due to her severe medical needs they…', intake_date = COALESCE(intake_date, '2025-11-01'), is_draft = 0, is_active = 1, needs_review = 0, is_courtesy = 0, is_available = 1, is_adopted = 0, is_hospice = 1, is_foster_needed = 0, is_temp_foster_needed = 0, is_adoption_pending = 0, foster_start_date = NULL, foster_end_date = NULL WHERE id = 47 AND name = 'Spork';
